mindmap
  root((The brief))
    Core: AI/NLP Risk Engine
      Read 2 or more text sources
        news articles
        social media posts
      For each company or event
        Sentiment score, -1 to +1
        Event type
        Impact score, 1 to 10
      Share signals through an API or a file
    Module A: index rebalancer
      Mock index of 10-20 S&P 100 stocks
      Good news means more weight
      Bad news means less weight
      Dashboard of weights over time
    Module B: stress testing
      Synthetic wholesale-bank portfolio
      Built from the given transaction data
      Loans, bonds, derivatives
      Big event, e.g. Geopolitical above 7
      Apply shocks to the portfolio
      Dashboard of value before and after
    What to hand in
      Public GitHub repo
      5-7 slides
      10-minute demo video
      Live demo and Q&A
